1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,445
Then the voice drops.

2
00:00:01,445 --> 00:00:05,195
Then I said softly to myself: That must have been the sun!

3
00:00:05,195 --> 00:00:11,731
She has watched the whole performance, and only worked out afterwards, by deduction, what caused it.

4
00:00:11,731 --> 00:00:17,812
It is charming, and it is the first sign that this speaker understands less than she describes.

